{%- comment -%}
  A section on your store's home page, between the welcome and the products.
  Use it for a banner, your story, featured products. Leave it empty to show nothing.
  products lists your products (name, price, url, image); store has your store's details.
  Example:
  <section class="featured">
    <h2>New this week</h2>
    <ul>
    {%- for product in products limit: 3 %}
      <li><a href="{{ product.url }}">{{ product.name }}: {{ product.price | money }}</a></li>
    {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>
{% endcomment -%}
